{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>וַיְצַו מֹשֶׁה אֶת בְּנֵי יִשְׂרָאֵל וְגוֹ׳.</b> Meaning, that he commanded them by order of HaShem, which He had commanded him to speak to Israel. And what did he command? ״כֵּן מַטֵּה בְנֵי יוֹסֵף״ and so forth — meaning, that the commandment came from HaShem that their claim and their words were true, and the intention in this was for the honor and glory of the sons of Joseph."], :book :numbers, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 36, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T20:17:19.310213645Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}